			"notes": "Ported to MC 1.21.11.\n\n### Changes\n- Piranhas spawn weight is increased significantly when Aquaculture is installed (Aquaculture's fish spawn weight are very high and were preventing piranhas from spawning), now they compete equally.\n- Hardcoded supported biomes for spawning piranhas have been removed and the mod now relies on the #c:is_swamp or #c:is_jungle or #c:is_river to spawn piranhas. This makes piranhas able to spawn in any modded biome that properly uses tags (which is the case for pretty much all the ones I've tested).\n- Piranhas will no longer spawn in cold biomes (marked as #c:is_cold)"
		},
